# Fabrication parts manifest.
#
# One line per STEP file to generate:
#
#   <FreeCAD document> | <body label> | <output filename>
#
# Blank lines and lines starting with # are ignored.
# Output filenames are written into the step directory at the repository root, and must be unique across the whole manifest.
# The directory is flat because that is what gets zipped into a release, so the exporter rejects duplicates and subdirectories.
# Bodies are matched on their Label, not their internal name, so renaming a body in FreeCAD means updating it here too.
# Filenames follow <Document>-<Body>.step, with a few legacy exceptions.
#
# Bodies that are deliberately NOT built:
#   ACK_E04_ELT_Bracket / ACK_E04_ELT         reference model of the ELT itself
#   ElevatorPulleyBracket / Pulley            machined phenolic pulley, bought not cut
#   TrailingEdgeBracket / Grommets            variant of BushingsGrommets
#   TrailingEdgeBracket / SnapBushings        variant of BushingsGrommets
#   TrailingEdgeBracket / Body2Bushings3Grommets  variant of BushingsGrommets
#
# Not every built body is 1mm aluminum sheet metal:
#   RudderPedalBracketAssembly / Bearing      Delrin bearing, not a bracket. Send Cut Send cuts plastic too.
#   TrailingEdgeBracket / Body                base profile the other trailing edge brackets derive from, exported for reference.
#
# Documents that are not bracket models and have no parts to build:
#   ch750sd.FCStd

ACK_E04_ELT_Bracket.FCStd | ACK_E04_ELT_Bracket | ACK_E04_ELT_Bracket-ACK_E04_ELT_Bracket.step

ElevatorPulleyBracket.FCStd | Bracket | ElevatorPulleyBracket-Bracket.step
ElevatorPulleyBracket.FCStd | Base | ElevatorPulleyBracket-Base.step

FuelReturnHoseBracket.FCStd | Body | FuelReturnHoseBracket.step

MatcoParkingBrakeBracket.FCStd | Bottom Bracket | MatcoParkingBrakeBracket-Bottom Bracket.step
MatcoParkingBrakeBracket.FCStd | Top Bracket | MatcoParkingBrakeBracket-Top Bracket.step

RudderPedalBracketAssembly.FCStd | LeftBracket | RudderPedalBracketAssembly-LeftBracket.step
RudderPedalBracketAssembly.FCStd | RightBracket | RudderPedalBracketAssembly-RightBracket.step
RudderPedalBracketAssembly.FCStd | Bearing | RudderPedalBracketAssembly-Bearing.step

TrailingEdgeBracket.FCStd | Body | TrailingEdgeBracket-Body.step
TrailingEdgeBracket.FCStd | BushingsGrommets | TrailingEdgeBracket-BushingsGrommets.step
TrailingEdgeBracket.FCStd | OutboardTrailingEdgeBracket | TrailingEdgeBracket-OutboardTrailingEdgeBracket.step
TrailingEdgeBracket.FCStd | OutboardTrailingEdgeBracketTape | TrailingEdgeBracket-OutboardTrailingEdgeBracketTape.step

WingtipWireBracket.FCStd | Body | WingtipWireBracket.step
